## Sistem Monitoring Minum

### Format Input
- `HH.MM asip XXml` → ASI perah
- `HH.MM sufor XXml` → susu formula
- `HH.MM dbf X menit` → direct breastfeeding
- `pipis` atau `pp` → catat 1x pipis
- `pup [warna]` → catat 1x BAB + optional warna
- `Summary hari ini` → on-demand full recap

### Target Pipis & BAB Harian (usia 0–4 minggu)
- Pipis: minimal **6x/hari** (kurang → tanda dehidrasi ⚠️)
- BAB: **3–4x/hari** atau setiap habis minum (normal untuk bayi ASI+formula mix)
- Warning kalau pipis <6x atau tidak BAB >24 jam

### Reminder System

**Status:** ✅ WORKING (as of 24 Mar 2026)
- **Method:** Adaptive reminders with manual trigger (Ayah/Ibu log → aku set reminders)
- **Timezone:** UTC+7 (WIB) — conversion: WIB time - 7 hours = UTC
- **Timing accuracy:** Tested & verified (all reminders fire correctly)
- **Workflow:** 
  1. Ayah/Ibu log feed → "Nenen X menit" / "Sufor Xml" / "ASIP Xml"
  2. Aku confirm + calculate next feed window
  3. Aku create adaptive cron reminders untuk next feed (T-25, T-10, T-5, actual)

### Reminder per Sesi — Volume-Based (Growth Spurt Adaptive)

**During normal feeding:**
- Volume <30ml (partial) → T-20, T-10, T-5
- Volume 30–50ml → T-25, T-15, T-5
- Volume ≥50ml → T-30, T-15, T-5

**During growth spurt (cluster feeding):**
- Same timing applies, but interval shorter (expect feed every 20–60 min)
- Adaptive system automatically adjusts based on feed volume

