- Feeding pattern: Every 20–60 min, small-medium volumes per session

**Diagnosis:** Growth spurt + cluster feeding
- **Timeline:** 2–3 minggu adalah peak period untuk first growth spurt
- **Expected duration:** 3–7 hari (est. resolution by 28–29 Mar)
- **Why cluster feeding:** Bayi need to maximize calorie intake untuk support growth

**Day 15 (24 Mar) Results:**
- **Feeds:** 14 sesi (3x DBF, 3x ASIP, 8x Sufor)
- **Intake:** ~1010–1154ml (2x target!) ✅✅✅
- **Diaper output:** 6x pipis ✅, 3x pup ✅ (hydration excellent!)
